# PX4 v1.17 / Gazebo Classic X500 HITL partial QGC parameter overlay.
# Tested on FMUv6C with PC UDP console on 2026-10-26; see simulation/docs/ALGORITHM_VALIDATION_2026-10-26.md.
# Import after firmware defaults with props removed; reboot before the first HITL flight.
# This config is for the 2.0893 kg X500 model, not the 5-6 kg real aircraft.
# USB goes to Gazebo. TELEM2 assumes TX/RX/GND at 921600; FLOW_CTRL=0.
# RC sticks disabled for terminal-only HITL; use ground-station heartbeat on PC.
# Hover thrust, HIL actuator mapping and supply/safety breakers apply only to HITL.
